{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":38724482,"ns":0,"title":"Meta-functional expertise","extract":"Meta-functional expertise is the breadth of one’s strategically important knowledge. It differs from the traditional conceptualization of expertise, which is generally considered to be a great depth of knowledge in a defined area, and where thus experts are people who are distinguished as knowing a lot about a particular subject.","description":"Breadth of one's strategically important knowledge","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}